# PocketBase untuk Azkasir
# schema dikelola lewat `bun run setup:db` — TANPA pb_migrations (lihat README)
ARG PB_VERSION=0.28.4
FROM alpine:3.20
ARG PB_VERSION

RUN apk add --no-cache unzip ca-certificates

ADD https://github.com/pocketbase/pocketbase/releases/download/v${PB_VERSION}/pocketbase_${PB_VERSION}_linux_amd64.zip /tmp/pb.zip
RUN unzip /tmp/pb.zip pocketbase -d /usr/local/bin && chmod +x /usr/local/bin/pocketbase

EXPOSE 8094
CMD ["/usr/local/bin/pocketbase", "serve", "--http=0.0.0.0:8094", "--dir=/pb_data", "--automigrate=false"]
